  ## What's Changed

  This release has the following bug fixes:

  ### FaderPort V2

  - Fixed issue where automation in touch mode did not stop on fader touch end
  - Fixed issue where pan with encoder did not write automation (Touch does not work)

  Thanx to everyone reporting issues and help me debug them.
